       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\n- **Daily total:** 3000 mg three times daily is 9,000 mg/day. The usual adult maximum is 4,000 mg/day, and many institutions cap it at 3,000 mg/day. 9 g/day is in the range that can cause serious hepatotoxicity and liver failure.\n- **Single dose:** 3000 mg is also three times the usual maximum single dose of 1,000 mg.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **1000 mg PO three times daily** (3,000 mg/day), or\n- **650 mg PO every 6 hours** (2,600 mg/day), or\n- **1000 mg PO every 8 hours**, or four times daily if your institution allows up to 4 g/day.\n\nTell me the dose and frequency you want and I'll enter it. If 3000 mg three times daily really is what you intended, please confirm that. I'd still suggest checking with pharmacy first."
